    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16072" root="رف" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَفَّةٌ</span></b>  [inf. n. of unity of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَفَّ</span>,] <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرْقَةٌ</span> [app. as
meaning <i>A flash of lightning</i>]: (IAar, T:) or <i>a
shining,</i> or <i>glistening.</i> (O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A quivering,</i>
or <i>throbbing.</i> (IAar, T.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>A sound act of
eating;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكْلَةٌ مُحْكَمَةٌ</span>. (IAar, T, O, K. [In
the CK, in this sense, erroneously written <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُفَّة</span>.])
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A suck.</i> (IAar, T.)

